From 38fcecee428857a2a30937594b845c74a83cdfea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fable <fable@local>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 11:13:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] W0-10 PR-1: migrate all operator readers onto
 deployment_assignments

Retire-in-place prep: every READER of the legacy operator columns
(Rig.operatorId, rig_operators/secondaryOperators, Vehicle.assignedOperatorId)
now resolves through the deployment_assignments table, while the columns and
their writers stay in place (dropped in PR-4). Non-revoking by construction:
auth grants on (open assignment) OR (legacy primary) OR (legacy secondary);
display/scan paths keep a legacy fallback so nothing blanks or fails closed.

New helpers in lib/deployment-assignments.ts: hasOpenAssignment,
getActivePrimaryForRig, getVehicleOperators (deterministic ORDER BY), plus
lib/deployment-auth.ts (isAuthorizedForRig / getAuthorizedActiveRig / getAuthorizedRig).

Four-agent review fixes: transfers list visibility unioned onto assignments;
cron + dashboard missed-check scan re-typed through Prisma with a legacy
fallback so a rig without an open PRIMARY is never silently dropped from
alerting; inventory detail operator fallback; vehicle-operator lookup deduped.

Deferred to later PRs (tracked in the migration plan): writer-adjacent
inverse-lookups (transfers/handoffs accept, handoff guard) + the DROP -> PR-4;
one-open-PRIMARY-per-rig partial unique index -> PR-2.
